{
  "id": 418781977,
  "iid": 21494,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "packet-noe.c: Fix checkapi issue",
  "description": "For case OPCODE_EVT_BT_BONDING_RESULT, the call to\nproto_tree_add_uint_format_value is inconsistent.\nIt claims the field is 1 byte long,\nextracts 2 bytes (unsigned),\ndisplays it as a signed integer,\nand the HF expects 4 bytes.\n\nNo solution is guaranteed to be perfect, but based on the other fields\nalso being UINTs, it would seem that the %d was\nintended to be %u and so we can use\nproto_tree_add_item with no loss of\ninformation.\n\nThis issue with checkAPI manifested after\nvalidating with the script in\nhttps://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/21492",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:54:39.423Z",
